{"seq":15,"slug":"ai-assisted-drug-discovery","title":"AI辅助药物发现","stage":"DONE","category":"biology-life-science","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/ai-assisted-drug-discovery","rating":{"composite":4.02,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":4.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"ai辅助药物发现\">AI辅助药物发现</h1><p>药物发现是人类对抗疾病最昂贵、最漫长的科研活动之一——一款新药从靶点识别到FDA批准平均耗时超过十年、耗资逾二十亿美元，而临床成功率不足十分之一。AI与机器学习正在系统性地重塑这条管线的每一个环节：从靶点识别的基因组学筛选，到生成式模型设计全新分子骨架，从蛋白质结构预测到临床试验患者分层。本 hub 面向计算化学、生物信息学与AI研究者，系统梳理AI在药物发现全流程中的核心技术与最新实践。</p>\n<p>四条主线按&quot;从靶点到病床&quot;的逻辑递进：<strong>药物发现基础</strong>建立传统管线的全局视角，理解AI在哪些瓶颈环节最具价值；<strong>生成式模型与分子设计</strong>深入分子表示学习、生成模型与性质预测三大核心技术；<strong>蛋白质结构与功能</strong>覆盖结构预测、从头设计与蛋白质-配体相互作用；<strong>临床前与临床阶段AI</strong>聚焦虚拟筛选、ADMET预测与真实世界证据挖掘。</p>\n<p>本 hub 专注于AI方法与药物发现的交叉领域。兄弟 hub 中，生物信息学基础涵盖测序与组学分析的通用方法，机器学习基础提供深度学习与图神经网络的原理讲解，计算化学基础则深入分子力学与量子化学。读者应具备基础生物学知识与机器学习背景，建议按章节顺序阅读，也可根据兴趣直接进入特定技术主题。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"drug-discovery-foundations","title":"药物发现基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/ai-assisted-drug-discovery/drug-discovery-foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"drug-discovery-pipeline","title":"药物发现流程与挑战","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/ai-assisted-drug-discovery/drug-discovery-foundations/drug-discovery-pipeline"},{"seq":2,"slug":"target-identification","title":"靶点识别与验证","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/ai-assisted-drug-discovery/drug-discovery-foundations/target-identification"},{"seq":3,"slug":"small-molecule-biologics","title":"小分子与生物药","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/ai-assisted-drug-discovery/drug-discovery-foundations/small-molecule-biologics"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"generative-molecular-design","title":"生成式模型与分子设计","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/ai-assisted-drug-discovery/generative-molecular-design","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"molecular-representation","title":"分子表示学习","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/ai-assisted-drug-discovery/generative-molecular-design/molecular-representation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"molecular-generation","title":"分子生成模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/ai-assisted-drug-discovery/generative-molecular-design/molecular-generation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"molecular-property-prediction","title":"分子性质预测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/ai-assisted-drug-discovery/generative-molecular-design/molecular-property-prediction"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"protein-structure-function","title":"蛋白质结构与功能","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/ai-assisted-drug-discovery/protein-structure-function","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"protein-structure-prediction","title":"蛋白质结构预测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/ai-assisted-drug-discovery/protein-structure-function/protein-structure-prediction"},{"seq":2,"slug":"protein-design","title":"蛋白质设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/ai-assisted-drug-discovery/protein-structure-function/protein-design"},{"seq":3,"slug":"protein-ligand-interaction","title":"蛋白质-配体相互作用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/ai-assisted-drug-discovery/protein-structure-function/protein-ligand-interaction"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"preclinical-clinical-ai","title":"临床前与临床阶段AI","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/ai-assisted-drug-discovery/preclinical-clinical-ai","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"drug-screening-prioritization","title":"药物筛选与优先级","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/ai-assisted-drug-discovery/preclinical-clinical-ai/drug-screening-prioritization"},{"seq":2,"slug":"admet-prediction","title":"ADMET预测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/ai-assisted-drug-discovery/preclinical-clinical-ai/admet-prediction"},{"seq":3,"slug":"clinical-trial-design-rwe","title":"临床试验设计与真实世界证据","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/ai-assisted-drug-discovery/preclinical-clinical-ai/clinical-trial-design-rwe"}]}]}